  "instructions_to_main_agent": [
    "CRITICAL: Build the UI purely with React Native components (`View`, `Text`, `TouchableOpacity`, `TextInput`, `FlatList`) and `StyleSheet.create()`. Do NOT use HTML tags (div, span) or Tailwind classes, as this is an Expo React Native application.",
    "GLASSMORPHISM: Since standard CSS backdrop-filter is unavailable in raw RN, achieve glassmorphism by using highly translucent RGBA backgrounds (e.g., `rgba(255,255,255,0.03)`) surrounded by a distinct 1px translucent white border (`rgba(255,255,255,0.08)`). If using Expo, utilize `expo-blur` with `intensity={30}` and `tint='dark'` for critical overlapping elements like bottom sheets or sticky headers.",
    "COLOR ASSIGNMENT: Map the requested accents properly. Gold (#F2A900) for security elements (PIN, Lock/Unlock states). Cyan (#00F0FF) for AI categorization triggers or search highlights. Deep Amethyst (#9D4CDD) for category chips and secondary interactive elements.",
    "TESTING: Apply the standard `testID=\"kebab-case-name\"` prop to all interactive elements (`TouchableOpacity`, `TextInput`, Buttons) instead of web's `data-testid`.",
    "ANIMATIONS: Use React Native's standard `LayoutAnimation` or `Animated` API for swipe actions on the Vault List and entering the universal input mode.",
    "SPACING: Follow the Generous Spacing rule. Cards must have substantial inner padding (minimum 20px). Lists should have at least 16px gap between items."
  ],
